    "title": "KPLR 11 to air SLU Billikens basketball games in November and December - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joey Schneider ,\n1 days ago\nST. LOUIS - KPLR 11 the CW will air several Saint Louis University Billikens men's basketball games in November and December, including next week's home opener.\nKPLR will carry four game broadcasts over the next two months, including the following matchups:\nSLU Billikens vs. Lehigh Mountain Hawks: Monday, Nov. 2 at 7 p.m. CT (Home Opener)\nSLU Billikens vs. Arkansas Pine Bluff Golden Lions: Wednesday, Dec. 2 at 7 p.m. CT\nSLU Billikens vs. Jackson State University Tigers: Sunday, Dec. 20 at 2 p.m. CT\nSLU Billikens vs. Missouri Baptist Spartans: Sunday, Dec. 27 at 2 p.m. CT\nAll four games are home matchups at Chaifetz Arena.\nAdditionally, KPLR 11 will carry a half-hour Billikens Insider special on 6:30 p.m. Sunday, and FOX 2 (KTVI) will carry the same special at 9:30 p.m. Sunday.\nHOW TO WATCH\nAnyone with access a cable plan or antenna in the St. Louis region can head to the primary KPLR channel to watch.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 2.\n5",
    "summary": "ST. LOUIS - KPLR 11 the CW will air several Saint Louis University Billikens men's basketball games in November and December, including next week's home opener.",
